WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[No sound. In-engine capture of the M2 map: the Negev, with Beersheba and Gaza.]

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
[Jerusalem and the coastal plain: Tel Aviv, Jaffa, Lod, Ramla and Rehovot.]

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
[North along the coast past Netanya and Hadera to Haifa, with Nazareth inland.]
